# Roaring Furnace: "When you unlock this door, this Room deals damage equal to the number of cards in your hand to target
# creature an opponent controls." Cast as its left door in turn 3, the Room enters with that door unlocked (CR 709.5d) and
# the ability triggers. Its target is a creature an opponent controls: Bot1's own Ornithopter is refused, and of Bot2's
# Llanowar Elves and Baloth Prime (10/10) the Baloth is chosen. With the trigger on the stack Bot1 casts Ancestral Recall
# on itself: three cards in hand become two and then five, and the number is read as the ability resolves (CR 608.2h), so
# the Baloth is dealt 5, not 3.

